See AUTHORS.

1. Hardware designs (CERN-OHL-S-2.0)
-----------------------------------
Covered Source includes mechanical CAD and electronics hardware design files,
for example:

- Fusion 360 / STEP / STL and other mechanical design files
- KiCad projects, schematics, PCB layouts, BOMs, and related electronics design files

These are licensed under the CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 -
Strongly Reciprocal (CERN-OHL-S-2.0).

Full text: LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt
SPDX: CERN-OHL-S-2.0

Credits for Covered Source:
- Zephino — mechanical design
- jrlomas — KiCad schematics, PCB layout, and related electronics

